    "created_at": "2017-01-30T23:20:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-30T23:20:08Z",
    "body": "This seems very reasonable and it solves the problem in a way that createImageBitmap can't.  I think the spec should be explicit about the fact that this API provides a \"soft guarantee\", especially if all implementations would otherwise be breaking the contract under RAM pressure.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
