    "created_at": "2017-02-24T18:49:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-24T18:49:23Z",
    "body": "General +1 from me. I agree there are reasonable times to reject the promise (e.g. excessively large images). I think we probably want to experiment in the wild before we codify the cases under which this promise rejects, but in the meantime we should probably have a non-normative note in the spec that calls out the large image case.",
